Abraham did not yet know what lay ahead of him.

45
01:17:34.434 --> 01:17:37.434
Abraham believed in something he had never seen before.

46
01:17:37.434 --> 01:17:41.434
And that is why God says, yes, you and I, we can continue together.

47
01:17:41.434 --> 01:17:45.434
Abraham, I always love to explain a timeline, then we know where we are.

48
01:17:45.434 --> 01:17:56.434
Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob. God changes Jacob's name from deceiver to Israel.

49
01:17:56.434 --> 01:18:01.434
He who struggles with God. He who wrestles with God.

50
