70
01:19:37.434 --> 01:19:39.434
It gives us indications.

71
01:19:39.434 --> 01:19:44.434
It tells us what God says, if you are my son, if you are my daughter.

72
01:19:44.434 --> 01:19:47.434
Then I want you to behave this way.

73
01:19:47.434 --> 01:19:48.434
I want you to live like this.

74
01:19:48.434 --> 01:19:52.434
I do not want you to live in the ways of the other nations.

75
01:19:52.434 --> 01:19:54.434
I do not want you to live like the pagans.

76
01:19:54.434 --> 01:19:58.434
I do not want you to offer your sons and daughters to the gods.

77
01:19:58.434 --> 01:20:00.434
I do not want you to behave this way.

78
01:20:00.434 --> 01:20:02.434
I want you to live my way.

79
01:20:02.434 --> 01:20:06.434
Be holy, says God, for I am holy.

80
01:20:06.434 --> 01:20:11.434
And so Moses symbolizes the giving of the law.

81
01:20:11.434 --> 01:20:14.434
Israel was all over the place.

82
01:20:14.434 --> 01:20:16.434
And Moses gives direction.

83
01:20:16.434 --> 01:20:18.434
And Moses gives identity.

84
01:20:18.434 --> 01:20:23.434
And Moses provides a model for the people of Israel by giving the law of God.

85
01:20:23.434 --> 01:20:28.434
If you want to get to know God, then Moses is the one who represents Him in the law.

86
01:20:28.434 --> 01:20:29.434
Now we move on.

87
01:20:29.434 --> 01:20:33.434
After Moses, etc., come the prophets, etc.

88
01:20:33.434 --> 01:20:36.434
