96
01:21:05.434 --> 01:21:07.434
David loved God.

97
01:21:07.434 --> 01:21:09.434
David had trust in God.

98
01:21:09.434 --> 01:21:13.434
David longed to be with God and he made music for God.

99
01:21:13.434 --> 01:21:17.434
Whether there were many people present or there were many sheep present.

100
01:21:17.434 --> 01:21:19.434
And there was no one else there.

101
01:21:19.434 --> 01:21:21.434
David was busy with God.

102
01:21:21.434 --> 01:21:25.434
David symbolizes the beginning of worship.

103
01:21:25.434 --> 01:21:29.434
David could touch God's heart by singing to God.

104
01:21:29.434 --> 01:21:33.434
And to touch God with beautiful poetic words carried by the spirit.

105
01:21:33.434 --> 01:21:36.434
David recognized God in God's emotion.

106
01:21:36.434 --> 01:21:39.434
For God is indeed a God of emotions.

107
01:21:39.434 --> 01:21:43.434
When people have emotions, it is because God has emotions.

108
01:21:43.434 --> 01:21:47.434
We are made in the image and likeness of God Himself.

109
01:21:47.434 --> 01:21:49.434
God has emotions.

110
01:21:49.434 --> 01:21:51.434
People have emotions.

111
01:21:52.434 --> 01:21:56.434
The law is not emotional.

112
01:21:56.434 --> 01:21:58.434
The law is fact.

113
01:21:58.434 --> 01:22:00.434
The law is, you must do this.

114
01:22:00.434 --> 01:22:02.434
Otherwise, that is the consequence.

115
01:22:02.434 --> 01:22:05.434
If you do this, I can bless you.

116
