123
01:22:24.434 --> 01:22:28.434
God is someone who says, if you do this, then I will do that.

124
01:22:28.434 --> 01:22:30.434
And my word is the truth.

125
01:22:30.434 --> 01:22:33.434
And my words and my promises, I will also fulfill them.

126
01:22:33.434 --> 01:22:38.434
But God wants us to touch Him with our emotions.

127
01:22:38.434 --> 01:22:42.434
God wants us to play His heart even.

128
01:22:42.434 --> 01:22:45.434
That we come to Him and sing for Him.

129
01:22:45.434 --> 01:22:50.434
