238
01:29:36.434 --> 01:29:42.434
I repeat, God's grace is there to help you...

239
01:29:42.434 --> 01:29:45.434
...to follow his laws and guidelines.

240
01:29:45.434 --> 01:29:51.434
God's grace is not meant to do what you want...

241
01:29:51.434 --> 01:29:54.434
...and then to say, Lord, you must bless me.

242
01:29:54.434 --> 01:29:58.434
If I were God, and I am absolutely not...

243
01:29:58.434 --> 01:30:00.434
...then it would become a wild party.

244
01:30:00.434 --> 01:30:03.434
But if I were God and I saw a people living...

245
01:30:03.434 --> 01:30:06.434
...who do not live as I want them to, I would also say that...

246
01:30:06.434 --> 01:30:08.434
...then I withdraw my blessings.

247
01:30:08.434 --> 01:30:10.434
That makes sense.

248
01:30:10.434 --> 01:30:16.434
And His Word confirms this also from the law that represents Moses.

249
01:30:16.434 --> 01:30:20.434
I want to give you two choices, life and death choose.

250
01:30:20.434 --> 01:30:22.434
Life.

251
01:30:22.434 --> 01:30:24.434
I will continue.

252
01:30:24.434 --> 01:30:26.434
Verse 10.

253
01:30:26.434 --> 01:30:29.434
Verse 9, sorry.

254
01:30:29.434 --> 01:30:34.434
And you, Solomon, love the God of your father.

255
01:30:34.434 --> 01:30:36.434
Serve Him wholeheartedly.

256
01:30:36.434 --> 01:30:40.434
