01:31:17.434 --> 01:31:20.434
I do not consider myself as King Solomon.

267
01:31:20.434 --> 01:31:22.434
Even if I were to consider myself as someone in the Bible...

268
01:31:22.434 --> 01:31:24.434
I would rather be a Peter figure.

269
01:31:24.434 --> 01:31:27.434
Impulsive, impatient, but I really want to be there.

270
01:31:27.434 --> 01:31:31.434
I do not see myself as a wise man, like King Solomon.

271
01:31:31.434 --> 01:31:34.434
But what I want to say now is...

272
01:31:34.434 --> 01:31:41.434
I see a parallelism with what God is doing in an open church.

273
01:31:41.434 --> 01:31:44.434
