274
01:31:44.434 --> 01:31:49.434
When I look at what God is doing in us as a church...

275
01:31:49.434 --> 01:31:53.434
Then I see that God wants to lead us into something new.

276
01:31:53.434 --> 01:31:56.434
Into new things, into new blessings.

277
01:31:56.434 --> 01:31:58.434
Into new promises that he has for us.

278
01:31:58.434 --> 01:32:00.434
And those promises have already been made.

279
01:32:00.434 --> 01:32:02.434
And now I come back to my parents.

280
01:32:02.434 --> 01:32:05.434
The promises began with the founders of the church.

281
01:32:05.434 --> 01:32:07.434
The promises have been laid down.

282
01:32:07.434 --> 01:32:10.434
And it was a vision that was not yet fully visible.

283
01:32:10.434 --> 01:32:12.434
It was a principle.

284
01:32:12.434 --> 01:32:15.434
You will go to the south of the country, the Netherlands.

285
01:32:15.434 --> 01:32:17.434
And also to the north of Belgium.

286
01:32:17.434 --> 01:32:19.434
And you will establish a church there.

287
01:32:19.434 --> 01:32:23.434
And what they have begun is like a first generation.

288
01:32:23.434 --> 01:32:26.434
Let me show you this parallelism.

289
01:32:26.434 --> 01:32:28.434
It has indeed been a generation...

290
01:32:28.434 --> 01:32:31.434
Where many people that I see here in this room...

291
01:32:31.434 --> 01:32:35.434
Together with my parents have been able to toil in a field.

292
01:32:35.434 --> 01:32:40.434
To prepare this area for what we now see happening among us.

293
01:32:41.434 --> 01:32:46.434
So the David generation under Kees and Agnes have been able to toil.

294
01:32:46.434 --> 01:32:48.434
Have been able to fight, I would say.

295
01:32:48.434 --> 01:32:51.434
Not that dad and mom have blood on their hands.

296
01:32:51.434 --> 01:32:54.434
Just as God says to David, you have blood on your hands.

297
01:32:54.434 --> 01:32:56.434
But let me put it in an agricultural way.

298
01:32:56.434 --> 01:32:58.434
Dad and mom do have mud on their hands.

299
01:32:58.434 --> 01:33:00.434
Because they have had to roughen.

300
01:33:00.434 --> 01:33:03.434
And they have had to grind and they have had to toil in a field...

301
01:33:03.434 --> 01:33:06.434
What hard ground was at the beginning of their ministry.

302
01:33:07.434 --> 01:33:09.434
And what we see here now...

303
01:33:09.434 --> 01:33:13.434
Is built as a second generation...

304
01:33:13.434 --> 01:33:16.434
On the sacrifices of the first generation.

305
01:33:17.434 --> 01:33:19.434
And I want to repeat this, dear church.

306
01:33:19.434 --> 01:33:21.434
What we see here now...

307
01:33:22.434 --> 01:33:24.434
And the blessings that we see here...

308
01:33:24.434 --> 01:33:27.434
And the second generation that we see coming forward...

309
01:33:27.434 --> 01:33:31.434
Is built on the backs and the sacrifices of the people...

310
01:33:31.434 --> 01:33:34.434
Who also saw it in the first generation.

311
01:33:34.434 --> 01:33:36.434
And put their shoulders under it.

312
01:33:36.434 --> 01:33:39.434
And invested their prayers in it.

313
01:33:39.434 --> 01:33:41.434
And invested their money in it.

314
01:33:41.434 --> 01:33:45.434
And for years set up chairs in buildings that were not ours.

315
01:33:45.434 --> 01:33:49.434
And for years have done and worked and worked.

316
01:33:49.434 --> 01:33:52.434
And who literally had skin on their hands instead of blood...

317
01:33:52.434 --> 01:33:53.434
Because they first had to get a place in this area.

318
01:33:53.434 --> 01:33:56.434
And in faith only saw what is now becoming a reality here.

319
01:33:56.434 --> 01:34:01.434
Do you know why I say this with so much passion?

320
01:34:03.434 --> 01:34:05.434


321
01:34:05.434 --> 01:34:06.434
This makes me warm.

322
01:34:06.434 --> 01:34:07.434
This makes me enthusiastic.

323
01:34:07.434 --> 01:34:08.434
Do you know why?

324
01:34:08.434 --> 01:34:11.434
Because I can also say against us in enthusiasm...

325
01:34:11.434 --> 01:34:16.434
But we must not keep harvesting from what other people have invested.

326
01:34:16.434 --> 01:34:19.434
And then think that you no longer have to put your shoulders to the wheel afterwards.

327
01:34:19.434 --> 01:34:22.434
For if a generation will eventually come...

328
01:34:22.434 --> 01:34:24.434
That will say it's all fine here.

329
01:34:24.434 --> 01:34:26.434
The first generation did it for me.

330
01:34:26.434 --> 01:34:29.434
I am the next generation and I don't have to do anything anymore.

331
01:34:29.434 --> 01:34:31.434
Ultimately it will die.

332
01:34:33.434 --> 01:34:35.434
Oh yes, I am enthusiastic about this.

333
01:34:38.434 --> 01:34:41.434
Next generation, I call on all of us.

334
01:34:42.434 --> 01:34:44.434
Put your shoulders to the wheel.

335
01:34:44.434 --> 01:34:46.434
Join in, be the church.

336
01:34:46.434 --> 01:34:49.434
Don't come to church, but be the church.

337
01:34:49.434 --> 01:34:51.434
Pray along.

338
01:34:51.434 --> 01:34:53.434
Sow along.

339
01:34:57.434 --> 01:35:00.434
I have seen things around me lately.

340
01:35:00.434 --> 01:35:02.434
And I also wrote that blog, do you remember?

341
01:35:02.434 --> 01:35:03.434
I am speaking well with you.

342
01:35:03.434 --> 01:35:04.434
I also wrote that blog.

343
01:35:04.434 --> 01:35:06.434
I have seen a church die.

344
01:35:06.434 --> 01:35:10.434
Why? Because I saw that church dying under the fact...

345
01:35:10.434 --> 01:35:13.434
that eventually a generation comes...

346
01:35:13.434 --> 01:35:16.434
that says to itself, it will all be fine.

347
01:35:16.434 --> 01:35:19.434
But I want to say to this generation...

348
01:35:19.434 --> 01:35:21.434
but not in this generation.

349
01:35:21.434 --> 01:35:23.434
I want to live together with Jesus.

350
01:35:23.434 --> 01:35:24.434
I want to continue.

351
01:35:24.434 --> 01:35:27.434
I want to show the Kempen that Jesus Christ is alive.

352
01:35:27.434 --> 01:35:29.434
That is what I want to pray for.

353
01:35:29.434 --> 01:35:31.434
That is what I want to give to.

354
01:35:31.434 --> 01:35:33.434
That is what I want to teach.

355
01:35:33.434 --> 01:35:35.434
To the humanity that is here in the room...

356
01:35:35.434 --> 01:35:37.434
