357
01:35:37.434 --> 01:35:41.434
All that shouting is of no use from a podium.

358
01:35:41.434 --> 01:35:44.434
If there is a room with people who think to themselves...

359
01:35:44.434 --> 01:35:46.434
it looks nice here.

360
01:35:46.434 --> 01:35:48.434
I like to go to this.

361
01:35:48.434 --> 01:35:51.434
No, God is not looking for the outside.

362
01:35:51.434 --> 01:35:53.434
God is looking for the inside.

363
01:35:53.434 --> 01:35:55.434
He wants you, church.

364
01:35:55.434 --> 01:35:58.434
This is what I am willing to give myself for.

365
01:35:58.434 --> 01:36:01.434
And I want to invite you in 2025...

366
01:36:01.434 --> 01:36:06.434
