369
01:36:12.434 --> 01:36:15.434
Because I know you from the first generation.

370
01:36:15.434 --> 01:36:16.434
I was born...

371
01:36:16.434 --> 01:36:18.434
This church is as old as I am.

372
01:36:18.434 --> 01:36:20.434
In the same year approximately.

373
01:36:20.434 --> 01:36:23.434
So I am 42 years old, you wouldn't say.

374
01:36:23.434 --> 01:36:25.434
But I am 42 years old.

375
01:36:25.434 --> 01:36:28.434
And the church is 42 years old.

376
01:36:28.434 --> 01:36:30.434
So I am as old as this church.

377
01:36:30.434 --> 01:36:33.434
And I have seen everything from that first generation.

378
01:36:33.434 --> 01:36:35.434
And my gratitude...

379
01:36:35.434 --> 01:36:37.434
My gratitude and my respect...

380
01:36:37.434 --> 01:36:41.434
