381
01:36:41.434 --> 01:36:43.434
You are kings in my eyes.

382
01:36:43.434 --> 01:36:46.434
May I have a round of applause for that first generation?

383
01:36:47.434 --> 01:36:49.434
Hallelujah.

384
01:36:49.434 --> 01:36:52.434
But we may...

385
01:36:52.434 --> 01:36:57.434
be the next generation.

386
01:36:57.434 --> 01:37:00.434
This is not about one King Solomon.

387
01:37:00.434 --> 01:37:04.434
I am talking about a generation that is being ushered in.

388
01:37:04.434 --> 01:37:07.434
I am talking about the next generation.

389
01:37:07.434 --> 01:37:10.434
I am talking about the next generation.

390
01:37:10.434 --> 01:37:13.434
I am talking about the next generation.

391
01:37:14.434 --> 01:37:17.434
I am talking about a generation...

392
01:37:17.434 --> 01:37:20.434
