452
01:40:15.434 --> 01:40:21.434
The design contained everything he had conceived by the Spirit for the temple of the Lord.

453
01:40:21.434 --> 01:40:24.434
In other words, God is a specific God.

454
01:40:24.434 --> 01:40:28.434
God is very specific in the details He gives.

455
01:40:28.434 --> 01:40:30.434
We do not have a vague God.

456
01:40:30.434 --> 01:40:32.434
We do not have a distant God who says, just do whatever.

457
01:40:32.434 --> 01:40:35.434
We have a God who is very specific.

458
01:40:35.434 --> 01:40:39.434
He is so specific with His creation...

459
01:40:39.434 --> 01:40:42.434
