462
01:40:52.434 --> 01:40:54.434
God is very specific.

463
01:40:54.434 --> 01:40:57.434
Your body is very specific.

464
01:40:57.434 --> 01:41:00.434
God is very detailed with everything He creates.

465
01:41:00.434 --> 01:41:05.434
So also ultimately when He gives the indications for His temple...

466
01:41:05.434 --> 01:41:08.434
He is very specific and detailed in what He wants.

467
01:41:08.434 --> 01:41:12.434
