468
01:41:12.434 --> 01:41:16.434
Lord, I want to understand You in 2025.

469
01:41:16.434 --> 01:41:21.434
I want to be able to understand You very detailed for my own life.

470
01:41:21.434 --> 01:41:23.434
Just for my own life.

471
01:41:23.434 --> 01:41:25.434
Just for your own life.

472
01:41:25.434 --> 01:41:27.434
You need to ask God very specifically...

473
01:41:27.434 --> 01:41:30.434
Lord, show me Your will.

474
01:41:30.434 --> 01:41:34.434
Show me what You want from me in 2025.

475
01:41:34.434 --> 01:41:36.434
Our Father in heaven.

476
01:41:36.434 --> 01:41:38.434
Hallowed be Your name.

477
01:41:38.434 --> 01:41:40.434
Your kingdom come.

478
01:41:40.434 --> 01:41:46.434
Your will be done on earth as it is in heaven in my life.

479
01:41:46.434 --> 01:41:47.434
Do you understand what I mean?

480
01:41:47.434 --> 01:41:50.434
Ask this of God.

481
01:41:50.434 --> 01:41:54.434
For what I read here is that God is a specific God.

482
01:41:55.434 --> 01:41:57.434
Where was I? Verse 12.

483
01:41:57.434 --> 01:42:02.434
On the design was everything he had conceived by the Spirit for the temple of the Lord.

484
01:42:02.434 --> 01:42:06.434
The courtyards, the rooms around it, the storerooms...

